    "description": "MAPPI (MAcro Plant Projection Imaging) is an open-source, low-cost, modular fluorescence imaging platform combining custom hardware and ScopeFoundry-based control software for real-time, wide-field, dual-projection imaging of fluorescent reporters in whole soil-grown plants, validated by tracking calcium and L-glutamate dynamics in adult Nicotiana benthamiana.",
